{"steam_appid":4078200,"steam_name":"Dwarf Eats Mountain","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4078200/207146464/d6bcd638ca192f25f507900b658a405c7ad219d4/1771369065/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771372261","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257289058/59506d1569c066c29d6de736714907e5a99675cb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771372261","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/9d61d30ca42f0a2f0285015b844574c8fd49ea63/ss_9d61d30ca42f0a2f0285015b844574c8fd49ea63.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786646580","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/b9be9fad4c142fb30691f76fbd024307a5c1b04d/ss_b9be9fad4c142fb30691f76fbd024307a5c1b04d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786646580","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/5b5c4668c4abf53e88613e7cc3716c94e2ce4da6/ss_5b5c4668c4abf53e88613e7cc3716c94e2ce4da6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786646580","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/a10f2c0b3257c2f878544ecf1c42380c3362a641/ss_a10f2c0b3257c2f878544ecf1c42380c3362a641.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786646580","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/0d45f895d188d0d6d8f10f06fda9617fe302a964/ss_0d45f895d188d0d6d8f10f06fda9617fe302a964.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786646580"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dwarf Eats Mountain</strong> is a strategic incremental game about devouring mountains for gold. <strong>Hire dwarves, deploy war machines, and collect powerful artifacts</strong> to build absurd synergies and grow faster each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9bfdb1c9cb2d5aca6486dde3281103cf.poster.avif?t=1786646580\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9bfdb1c9cb2d5aca6486dde3281103cf.webm?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9bfdb1c9cb2d5aca6486dde3281103cf.mp4?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hurting the mountain physically (and emotionally) is only half the battle—<strong>you still have to safely haul the gold home.</strong> That perilous job falls to the Runners, who weave through falling rocks, risking their beards to feed the Great Maw!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/6b9c04d6d0c2cccc2603536d95da2694.poster.avif?t=1786646580\" width=680 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/6b9c04d6d0c2cccc2603536d95da2694.webm?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/6b9c04d6d0c2cccc2603536d95da2694.mp4?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware—the Great Mother won’t give up her treasure easily. <strong>The more damage your greedy dwarves deal to the mountain, the more calamities it unleashes upon the wobbling beards below!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance mining with hauling your gold home—before the sky falls on your head.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/f0c5e8bdb13825c3e5d789b79fd3259f.poster.avif?t=1786646580\" width=720 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/f0c5e8bdb13825c3e5d789b79fd3259f.webm?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/f0c5e8bdb13825c3e5d789b79fd3259f.mp4?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the dwarven ways of treasure extraction!</strong>  <br>This game is about making numbers go up, but the way you do that is open to your interpretation and ingenuity. At your fingertips:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many buildings and dwarves, each with various strengths and weaknesses, such as dynamite throwers, ballistas, flamers, laser cannons, spelunkers, runesmiths, brewmasters, bulldozers, gyrocopters and more!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire countless upgrades and cast active rituals to buff your dwarves and their machines</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 120+ ancient artifacts and display them in your gallery, each with build-shaping effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 96+ prestige upgrades to replay, accelerate progress, and discover new synergies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend rare resources like mithril and mountain souls on tough choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover what the gods have hidden beneath the world spire—and what happened to those who dug too deep</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9757850b0f38aec1b9c83c2b0d0059a6.poster.avif?t=1786646580\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9757850b0f38aec1b9c83c2b0d0059a6.webm?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/9757850b0f38aec1b9c83c2b0d0059a6.mp4?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/f103074bddaac420c3533fcb22effadd.poster.avif?t=1786646580\" width=360 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/f103074bddaac420c3533fcb22effadd.webm?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078200/extras/f103074bddaac420c3533fcb22effadd.mp4?t=1786646580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> potato or 2.7 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB, but not really<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 130 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> strong potato<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB, but not really<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 130 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Green Wizard"],"publishers":["Green Wizard"],"release_date":"18 May, 2026"}